abstract: >-
  Idempotent DuckDB warehouse with a data-quality gate that aborts before downstream
  writes, two independently calibrated risk models for churn and late payment, a
  leakage test enforcing the forward-looking label window, and an LLM-written ops
  narrative with explicit graceful degradation.
